# The pattern the step-entry traces (docs/15 S4) start from: one bar on
# track 1 (index 0), four notes, stopped, at 240 BPM so the 2 s run plays
# the bar twice once PLAY/STOP is pressed. tests/test_seq_ui.py plays it
# with Test Sine.
#! rate=44118 block=64 tracks=8 end=88236
@0 bpm 24000;tog 0 0 48 110;tog 0 4 55 90;tog 0 8 60 100;tog 0 12 63 90
